# The Dockerfile COPYs `collector/` and `healthcheck/` wholesale into the build
# stage and compiles them there for linux/scratch. Anything already built on the
# developer's machine is dead weight in the context: a Mach-O arm64 binary that
# cannot run in the image, shipped to the daemon on every build.
#
# For the collector that is 227MB of upload per build. Both are also gitignored,
# but .gitignore does not govern the Docker build context — an untracked file in
# the directory is still sent.
collector/collector
healthcheck/healthcheck

# Go build/test detritus that likewise has no place in the context.
**/*.test
**/*.out
**/.DS_Store
